authoring_notes = "Step 7C S006 approved Chapter 0 aftermath scene. Resolves Chapter 0 consequences without identifying the damaged Card. Ilyra independently remains because survivor recovery is unfinished, the Card presents unanswered risk, Cyanis's condition remains unresolved, and her expertise materially changes the recovery effort. The scene commits permanent party state Cyanis + Ilyra, completes the six mandatory Chapter 0 sequences, unlocks Brackenwall as the next main-story route, and makes C01 The Fire Is Too Close and C02 Food After Triage available after S006 without auto-skipping them. No romance/destiny recruitment framing, no First Mercy response, no Prime/First Champion identification, no player dialogue choices."
