"text": "And nobody opens that casing.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 30, "staging": "Post-crisis artifact protocol is conservative and reasonable.", "camera": "Keep sealed casing in frame.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "CARD_STAYS_SEALED"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B020",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "No argument there.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "Cyanis agrees immediately; he has no curiosity-over-safety compulsion.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B021",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "It goes to Brackenwall sealed. Their artifact protocol can decide what happens next.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 45, "staging": "Establish Brackenwall as the next main-story operational stop without previewing the later confiscation failure.", "camera": "Show surviving wagon and road direction out of camp.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "ROUTE_BRACKENWALL_ESTABLISHED", "CARD_TRANSFER_PROTOCOL_PENDING"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B022",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "Not alone.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 25, "staging": "Ilyra identifies the medical consequence of moving the unexplained object.", "camera": "Return to her.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B023",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Meaning?",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 25, "staging": "Officer asks for the operational reason.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B024",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "Whatever happened ran through Dovaren. I can keep him stable if it happens again. I can't do that from another wagon.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 50, "staging": "Ilyra states expertise and unresolved risk. No mystical interpretation and no romantic entitlement.", "camera": "Cyanis and sealed wagon both remain visible.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "DAMAGED_CARD_UNANSWERED_RISK", "ILYRA_EXPERTISE_MATERIALLY_CHANGES_RECOVERY"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B025",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Comforting.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 25, "staging": "Small dry reaction to being described as a medical variable.", "camera": "Do not isolate as romantic banter.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "CYANIS_DRY_HUMOR"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B026",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "It wasn't meant to be.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 60, "staging": "Dry precision from Ilyra; immediate return to practical stakes.", "camera": "Hold shared work frame.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "ILYRA_DRY_HUMOR"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B027",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Your medical group takes the first wounded column to Brackenwall.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "The larger medical group has an independent duty to move casualties onward.", "camera": "Show medical group preparing transport.", "movement": "Walking wounded begin organizing for later departure.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "MEDICAL_GROUP_TO_BRACKENWALL"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B028",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "They should.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 25, "staging": "Ilyra agrees with the medical logistics rather than treating her group as followers.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B029",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "And you?",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 30, "staging": "The decision is explicitly Ilyra's.", "camera": "No dramatic recruitment framing.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "ILYRA_AGENCY_CHECKPOINT"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B030",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "I'm staying with the recovery.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 45, "staging": "Ilyra states her own continued mission. This is the narrative recruitment decision without gamey join-party language.", "camera": "Keep Cyanis out of dominant foreground; this is her decision.", "movement": "Ilyra secures her field kit for movement.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "ILYRA_PERMANENT_RECRUITMENT_DECISION"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B031",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Your assignment was convoy medical support.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "The officer asks her to define how that duty continues now that the convoy is broken.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B032",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "The convoy still has missing people.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 55, "staging": "Her answer is duty to living people, not attachment to the supernatural event.", "camera": "South wreck route remains visible beyond her.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "SURVIVOR_RECOVERY_UNFINISHED"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B033",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "The Card is an unanswered risk. Dovaren's condition is unresolved. And there may still be patients who don't know this camp exists.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 55, "staging": "Ilyra states the three practical reasons her expertise is still required.", "camera": "Move between sealed wagon, Cyanis, and south search route.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "DAMAGED_CARD_UNANSWERED_RISK", "CYANIS_CONDITION_UNRESOLVED", "POSSIBLE_MISSING_PATIENTS"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B034",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "So you're extending your own assignment.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 30, "staging": "He names the professional reality without converting it into permission from Cyanis.", "camera": "Hold on Ilyra.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B035",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "Yes.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 65, "staging": "Simple ownership of the decision.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "ILYRA_AGENCY_CONFIRMED"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B036",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "You don't owe me that.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "Cyanis refuses to treat medical care or shared danger as a personal debt.", "camera": "Two-shot, no romantic framing.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "NO_CARE_DEBT"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B037",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "I'm not doing it for you.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 65, "staging": "Direct boundary: her recruitment is not devotion to Cyanis.", "camera": "Keep the camp and missing-person route in frame.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "NO_ROMANCE_RECRUITMENT", "NO_DESTINY_RECRUITMENT"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B038",
"speaker_id": "",
"text": "",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 100, "staging": "A beat. Cyanis accepts the correction instead of making her decision about him.", "camera": "Neutral work-focused composition.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["CINEMATIC_WORLD_BEAT"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B039",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "There are still people missing.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 60, "staging": "Protected shared-commitment idea stated plainly.", "camera": "South wreck route.", "movement": "Ilyra shoulders her medical kit.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "SHARED_COMMITMENT_WORK_NOT_FINISHED"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B040",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Then we find them.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 75, "staging": "Cyanis answers the work, not a romantic overture.", "camera": "Two-shot becomes shared movement orientation toward south route.", "movement": "Cyanis prepares to stand.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "CYANIS_ILYRA_RECOVERY_TEAM_FORMED"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B041",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Fine. Finish the sweep together. Brackenwall afterward. The Card stays sealed.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 40, "staging": "Formal operational handoff: bounded recovery now, Brackenwall next, conservative artifact protocol unchanged.", "camera": "Show both search route and Brackenwall road marker in geography.", "movement": "Officer turns back toward transport preparation.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "SURVIVOR_RECOVERY_CONTINUES", "ROUTE_BRACKENWALL_UNLOCK_PENDING_SCENE_END", "CARD_STAYS_SEALED"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B042",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Yes, sir.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 25, "staging": "Cyanis preserves legitimate command hierarchy.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B043",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "Understood.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 75, "staging": "Ilyra accepts the operational handoff without becoming subordinate to Cyanis.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B044",
"speaker_id": "",
"text": "",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "staging": "As Cyanis stands, he notices blood across the side of Ilyra's glove from a small untreated cut acquired during the fighting.", "camera": "Subtle hand insert; do not glamorize injury.", "movement": "Ilyra is already reaching for search supplies instead of treating herself.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["ILYRA_SELF_NEGLECT_EARLY", "CYANIS_NOTICES_ILYRA_CONDITION"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B045",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Your hand.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 25, "staging": "He notices the same pattern she noticed in him.", "camera": "Return to two-shot.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B046",
"speaker_id": "ilyra",
"text": "Superficial.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 30, "staging": "Ilyra minimizes her own injury in exactly the functional language her arc warns about.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "She closes the glove over it.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "ILYRA_SELF_NEGLECT_EARLY"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S006_B047",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "You can wait. Don't mistake that for fine.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
